{"overview":"از زمانی که از تخم‌مرغ بیرون آمد، اژدهای تنها به نام «عمو پرها» توسط خانواده‌ای از گربه‌های جادویی پذیرفته شد و همچون یکی از آن‌ها بزرگ شد؛ با رشد عمو پرها، او به محافظ گربه‌ها تبدیل می‌شود و مصمم است تا آن‌ها را از انسان‌ها حفظ کند، اما وقتی می‌بیند گربه‌ها با جادوی خود به انسان‌ها نزدیک می‌شوند، به تدریج دلش برای انسان‌ها نرم می‌شود و این داستان دل‌نشین و تلخ‑شیرین روایتگر این تغییر است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"An orphan since hatched, a lone dragon named “Uncle Wings” is taken in by a family of magic-wielding cats and raised as one of their own. As Uncle Wings grows, he becomes the cats’ protector, determined to keep them safe from humans. But as he watches the cats connect with humans using their magic, Uncle Wings slowly starts to warm up to humans in this heartfelt, bittersweet tale.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/dhoCxAW431DQBA3u9f6mwJJfAbb.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":["オジング"],"crew_en":["Oh Jin-koo"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"子安武人","role":"Nekoryu (voice)","photo":"/8uBkNDKPNmp9JWgMUI02NVyfhi1.jpg","en":"Takehito Koyasu"},{"name":"井上喜久子","role":"Mamanyan (voice)","photo":"/pPxGWy53FgYSC79zmxblmHe0gI3.jpg","en":"Kikuko Inoue"},{"name":"和泉風花","role":"Shirotae (voice)","photo":"/nTC0TuLp4Ek3b08DG9lhwVJHwlW.jpg","en":"Fuka Izumi"},{"name":"速水奨","role":"Kurobane (voice)","photo":"/HU9LZJdb4H8coHiSaHiUprcFm1.jpg","en":"Show Hayami"},{"name":"杉山紀彰","role":"Haibuchi (voice)","photo":"/szqqQ8T0gzuSxjU2rnWcthsaSJT.jpg","en":"Noriaki Sugiyama"},{"name":"河瀬茉希","role":"Chikuro (voice)","photo":"/3LgHKyXM33oOtBzmYTDesftIzY0.jpg","en":"Maki Kawase"},{"name":"徳留慎乃佑","role":"Kurotama (voice)","photo":"/nt57RoIE4SuAslb4BNIXVoYxGwO.jpg","en":"Shinnosuke Tokudome"},{"name":"آتسومی تانه‌زاکی","role":"(voice)","photo":"/6tM8GU7QvrdUCvR4kxqVUZivtvO.jpg","en":"Atsumi Tanezaki"},{"name":"安済知佳","role":"(voice)","photo":"/lk3Az9O67qrXR69rctwDDHWqi9d.jpg","en":"Chika An